    "chunk_text": "willa\u00f0, So\u00f0 is, so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t eow is \u00feearf, \u00fe\u00e6t ge healdan \u00feone halgan sunnand\u00e6g mid rihte And gif ge nella\u00f0 \u00feyssum gewritum gelefan, ic sende ofer eow wyrmas and fuhlas wedende, and \u00fea And ic sende h\u00e6\u00f0en folc ofer eow, \u00fee eow ofnima\u00f0 eowre \u00e6hte and eower lif and eowere wif and cild, So\u00f0 is, so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow secge, gif ge lesa\u00f0 in lehtune wyrte on sunnand\u00e6g, ic sende n\u00e6dran Gif ge ne healda\u00f0 \u00feone halgan sunnand\u00e6g, \u00f0onne beo\u00f0 on eowrum husum acennede cild, \u00fee ne geseo\u00f0 And ge\u00feenca\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ge synd \u00fe\u00e6s oft gemyngad; and gif ge healda\u00f0 mine beboda, ealle god ic gehate And swa hwylc m\u00e6ssepreost, swa h\u00e6bbe \u00feis gewrit and nelle cy\u00f0an godes folce, \u00feonne cwe\u00f0 se \u00d0is gewrit w\u00e6s afunden in Hierusalem, and \u00feanan hit becom to Rome and to Sancte Petres Ongeota\u00f0 ge godes word, and his larum hersumia\u00f0, for\u00f0an \u00fee eow neal\u00e6c\u00f0 se dea\u00f0 toweardes. And gif ge nella\u00f0 gelefan, ic sende to eow beornendne ren and sweflene leg, and eow forde\u00f0 and And \u00e6fter \u00feyssum gewrite ne cym\u00f0 eow nan o\u00f0er fram me. And gelefa\u00f0 \u00feissum gewrite \u00feurh drihten sylfne and \u00feurh englas and heahenglas for \u00fe\u00e6ra mihte and Seo him drihtne simle \u00feanc ge \u00fe\u00e6s ge ealra his geofena, lof and wuldor a in ecnesse a butan ende,.",
